[275.302497, "o", "# Dr. Lydia Moreno Research Profile\r\n\r\nA clean static personal website built from the CV content in `info.md`.\r\n\r\n## Pages\r\n\r\n- `index.html` — About Me, research interests, projects, education, contact, teaching, and skills.\r\n- `publications.html` — Selected publications and project-related research outputs.\r\n- `blog.html` — Blog landing page with recent posts and summaries.\r\n\r\n## Local preview\r\n\r\nOpen `index.html` in a browser, or serve the directory locally:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 -m http.server 8000\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen visit <http://localhost:8000>.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 test_static_site.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Security note\r\n\r\nThe GitHub Actions workflow deploys a static site to GitHub Pages using the official Pages actions and least-privilege permissions. The previous workflow behavior that archived and uploaded the entire repository to an external endpoint has been removed.\r\n"]
